OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with a few showers this
OL,7,Fevening. Some clear intervals
OL,8,Fdeveloping tonight especially around
OL,9,FGlasgow, but still the odd shower
OL,10,Fdrifting in from the west, perhaps
OL,11,Fheavy over western Argyll.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FSome bright or sunny
OL,14,Fintervals along with scattered
OL,15,Fshowers, these turning heavier in the
OL,16,Fafternoon and evening with the chance
OL,17,Fof thunder especially over Kintyre and
OL,18,FAyrshire.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
